# CSVs are fully derived from data/snapshot.json + the labelling code, and
# are distributed via the workflow's email/artifact steps, not git — keep
# them out to avoid noisy diffs on every run.
data/output/
data/month2.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env

# data/snapshot.json, data/snapshot.json.previous and data/location-cache.json
# are DELIBERATELY NOT ignored, for local dev convenience - but as of the
# Railway migration (DECISIONS.md D15/D16) they are NOT what production
# actually reads or writes: the live service keeps its own copies on a
# Railway volume (FEED_DATA_DIR), and nothing commits them back to git
# anymore. The versions checked into this repo are a frozen snapshot from
# the last GitHub Actions run (28 Aug 2026) and will not update on their own.
